        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "34eab154-f73d-59a4-8252-fed4d964ad45",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tove Jansson, Björk, Sjón\n- Works: Comet in Moominland, Moomins and the Comet Chase, The Comet Song\n- Series: Moomin books, The Moomins TV series\n- Organizations: Se-ma-for\n\nFacts:\n- In 1943, Tove Jansson held her first solo art exhibition.\n- Comet in Moominland is the second book in Tove Jansson's Moomin book series.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase is a 2010 3D stop motion animated fantasy adventure comedy family film.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase was compiled from Comet in Moominland-based episodes of The Moomins TV series that originally ran from 1977 to 1982.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase was animated at Se-ma-for in Poland and was restored and re-soundtracked with multiple voice actors replacing a single narrator.\n- The Comet Song is a song by Björk written with Sjón as the title theme for the 2010 film Moomins and the Comet Chase.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
